      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>But they don't need me, they need stability. They need someone who isn't always drowning. I look at them and all I see is how much my struggle is actually hurting them. It feels like the more I try to be there, the more I'm just dragging them down into this hole with me. It's not even about me being sad anymore, it's just that my existence is making their lives harder.",
